for pay adjustment for smoothness. This paragraph may be deleted for projects 
where a profilograph cannot record<MET> 161 meters</MET><ENG> 0.10 of a mile</ENG> in length. Profilograph 
testing is required for runways, taxiways and landing zone pavements.</NPR><BRK/>
